SistersOfDiscord: {
	Spawn: {
		1: Well hello there, what a surprise to see YOU here~!
		2: {
			Broodmother: Oh yes, I've heard PLENTY about you, kid...you've been stirring up quite a bit of trouble in these parts...
			None: Oh yes, I've heard PLENTY about you, kid...you're the little warm-blood who thrashed my mother..!
		}
		3: {
			Both: And mine...
			Hydra: ...and you also hurt my mom...
			None: You're a pretty annoying wretch, you know...
		}
		4: So now..! Heh...
		5: We're gonna give you something to absolutely SCREAM about..! Come on, Hakie, let's torch this little warm-blood~!
		6: Please don't call me Hakie again...ever.
	}
	AsheDowned: OW..! THAT HURT, YOU MEANIE!
	HarukaDowned: Rgh..! Ow...
	Defeat: {
		First: {
			1: You see Ashe? I told you this was a stupid idea, but YOU didn't listen...
			2: {
				Front: "Shut up! I thought if we ganged up on "
				Back: ", we could just beat the daylights out of 'em!"
			}
			3: Whatever...I'm going back home. SOMEONE has to tell dad about this kid.
			4: Hmpf..! Fine! Be that way! I'm going back to the inferno!
		}
		1: RRRRRRRRRGH! NOT AGAIN!!!
		2: Why do I keep going with you..? I should honestly just let you fight them yourself.
		3: Rgh..! Shut up..!
	}
}

Akuma: {
	Attack: {
		Skyfall: {
			A: Hey kid! Sky's fallin', watch out!
			B: Down comes fire and fury!
		}
		BigShot: {
			A: Hey kid! Watch out!
			B: Incoming!
		}
		SeekingFlames: {
			A: Face the flames of despair, kid!
			B: Heads up, kid!
		}
	}
	WaterHit: Water?! ACK..! I CAN'T BREATHE!
	Despawn: {
		Night: Yaaaaaaaaawn. I'm bushed kid, I'm gonna have to take a rain check. Come back tomorrow.
		Escape: I thought you terrarians put up more of a fight. Guess not.
	}

	Defeat: {
		Status: The volcanoes of the inferno are finally quelled...
		NotExpert: Hmpf...you’re pretty good kid, but not good enough. Come back once you’ve gotten a bit better.
	}

	Transition: {
		1: Heh...
		2: You know, kid...
		3: fanning the flames doesn't put them out...
		4: Akuma has been Awakened!
		5: IT ONLY MAKES THEM STRONGER!
		6: The air around you begins to heat up...
	}

	Awakened: {
		AsheAppear: {
			First: {
				Ashe: Hey! Hands off my papa!
				Akuma: Atta-girl..!
			}
			Ashe: You got it, daddy..!
			Akuma: Ashe? Help your dear old dad with this kid again!
		}

		Defeat: {
			Repeat: Heh, not too shabby this time kid. I'm impressed. Here. Take your prize.
			First: GRAH..! HOW!? HOW COULD I LOSE TO A MERE MORTAL TERRARIAN?! Hmpf...fine kid, you win, fair and square. Here's your reward.
			Cheat: Nice. You cheated. Now come fight me in expert mode like a real man.
		}

		DayReset: Nighttime won't save you from me this time, kid! The day is born anew!
		Kill: You just got burned, kid.
	}

	#Unused
	Akuma6: Spirits of the volcano! help me crush this kid!
	Akuma9: Sun's shining, and there's no shade to be seen, kid!
	Akuma10: Getting hotter, ain't it?
	AkumaA5: Still got it, do you? Ya got fire in your spirit! I like that about you, kid!
	AkumaA6: What?! How have you lasted this long?! Why you little... I refuse to be bested by a terrarian again! Have at it!
	AkumaA7: ACK..! WATER! I LOATHE WATER!!!
	AkumaA13: Sky's fallin' again! On your toes!
	AkumaA14: Down comes the flames of fury again!
	AkumaA15: You underestimate the artillery of a dragon, kid!
	AkumaA16: Flames don't give in till the end, kid!
	AkumaA17: Heads up! Volcano's eruptin' kid!
	AkumaA18: INCOMING!
	AkumaA19: Hey Kid? Like Fireworks? No? Too Bad!
	AkumaA20: Here comes the grand finale, kid!
	AkumaA21: The Sun won't quit 'til the day is done, kid!
	AkumaA22: Face the fury of the sun!
	AkumaAAshe1: Papa, NO! HEY! YOU! I'm gonna bake you alive next time we meet..!
	AkumaAAshe2: OW, you Jerk..! I'm out!
}

